{"id":"8a59ed3a01d1c804","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm.md","title":"有限延伸范式","display":"thm-finite-extension-paradigm — 有限延伸范式","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm","aliases":["20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm"],"display":"thm-finite-extension-paradigm — 有限延伸范式","chapter":"14","section":"14.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 14.2.1","source_pdf_pages":[243],"source_printed_pages":[214],"depends_on":["[[20-df-cohen-forcing]]","[[20-df-K]]","[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-extension-paradigm — 有限延伸范式"},{"key":"chapter","html":"14"},{"key":"section","html":"14.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 14.2.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>243</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>214</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"81a15e6b69aa82ec\" href=\"?note=81a15e6b69aa82ec\" title=\"20-df-cohen-forcing\">20-df-cohen-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=(V_e)\">\\(V=(V_e)\\)</span> 是按有限串代码解释的统一 c.e. 序列，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniformCE}(V)\">\\(\\operatorname{UniformCE}(V)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81a15e6b69aa82ec\" href=\"?note=81a15e6b69aa82ec\" title=\"20-df-cohen-forcing\">20-df-cohen-forcing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" href=\"?note=fc75264a5ecdc3fb\" title=\"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence\">20-df-uniform-ce-sequence</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}extension\\text{-}paradigm}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\ \\forall e\\\n[(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\sigma\\in V_e)\\lor\n(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ \\tau\\notin V_e)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}extension\\text{-}paradigm}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\ \\forall e\\\n[(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\sigma\\in V_e)\\lor\n(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ \\tau\\notin V_e)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_0=\\varnothing\">\\(\\sigma_0=\\varnothing\\)</span>。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 判断是否存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\succeq\\sigma_e\">\\(\\rho\\succeq\\sigma_e\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in V_e\">\\(\\rho\\in V_e\\)</span>。这是可统一编译的 c.e. 搜索停止问题。若存在，按固定枚举顺序找到这样的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>，置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{e+1}=\\rho0\">\\(\\sigma_{e+1}=\\rho0\\)</span>；若不存在，置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_{e+1}=\\sigma_e0\">\\(\\sigma_{e+1}=\\sigma_e0\\)</span>。长度每步严格增长。</p>\n<p>有见证时保留的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 是最终 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\bigcup_e\\sigma_e\">\\(G=\\bigcup_e\\sigma_e\\)</span> 的前缀且在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e\">\\(V_e\\)</span>；无见证时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_e\">\\(\\sigma_e\\)</span> 的所有延伸均不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e\">\\(V_e\\)</span>。因此每项被决定。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(n)\">\\(G(n)\\)</span> 只需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 重建有限多个阶段，直到前缀长于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\le_T K\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(G\\le_T K\\equiv_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。查询包含非严格延伸，避免在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_e\\in V_e\">\\(\\sigma_e\\in V_e\\)</span> 且无更长成员时错误宣称“所有延伸均避开”。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 14.2.1；印刷 214 / PDF 243。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-cohen-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"81a15e6b69aa82ec","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cohen-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cohen-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"81a15e6b69aa82ec","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cohen-forcing]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cohen-forcing]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-uniform-ce-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"fc75264a5ecdc3fb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cohen-forcing]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cohen-forcing]]；see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"V=(V_e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniformCE}(V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}finite\\text{-}extension\\text{-}paradigm}\\vdash\n\\exists G\\le_T\\varnothing'\\ \\forall e\\\n[(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\sigma\\in V_e)\\lor\n(\\exists\\sigma\\preceq G\\ \\forall\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ \\tau\\notin V_e)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma_0=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\succeq\\sigma_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in V_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{e+1}=\\rho0","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_{e+1}=\\sigma_e0","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\bigcup_e\\sigma_e","display":false},{"tex":"V_e","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_e","display":false},{"tex":"V_e","display":false},{"tex":"G(n)","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"G\\le_T K\\equiv_T\\varnothing'","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_e\\in V_e","display":false}],"bytes":1878,"backlinks":[{"id":"eb7be9972d7be6ba","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-uniform-ce-sequence]]；see [[20-thm-finite-extension-paradigm]]；see [[20-df-join]]；see [[20-thm-1gen-low]]；see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-strings]]。"}],"outgoing":["81a15e6b69aa82ec","0e6b2238da5572e4","fc75264a5ecdc3fb","de54fb8c1326b2f0"]}